(7721115, 1270726, 30861, '<td valign="top">My Lord, this is exquisitely crafted :-) I especially admire the perfect dripping and the inspired inclusion of a little extra space on the right. A bravura performance of lighting and composition.</td>', 'My Lord, this is exquisitely crafted :-) I especially admire the perfect dripping and the inspired inclusion of a little extra space on the right. A bravura performance of lighting and composition.', '2022-06-02 11:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721116, 1270754, 30861, '<td valign="top">GROAN!!! A full extra point for the title!</td>', 'GROAN!!! A full extra point for the title!', '2022-06-02 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721117, 1270753, 30861, '<td valign="top">What an exquisite sense of time &amp; place :-) I''ve lived there, so to speak, I can breathe and smell what I am seeing here. I used to live 2 blocks from the commercial fishing harbor in San Diego; this was my milieu, and I loved it.</td>', 'What an exquisite sense of time & place :-) I''ve lived there, so to speak, I can breathe and smell what I am seeing here. I used to live 2 blocks from the commercial fishing harbor in San Diego; this was my milieu, and I loved it.', '2022-06-02 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721118, 1270458, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Love the slightly eccentric framing, just off-center, as I imagine she might be, a quirky great-grandma :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous. Love the slightly eccentric framing, just off-center, as I imagine she might be, a quirky great-grandma :-)', '2022-06-02 12:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721119, 1270748, 30861, '<td valign="top">Utterly immersive. Well done!</td>', 'Utterly immersive. Well done!', '2022-06-02 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721120, 1270724, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely scene, an iconic bit of Yosemite, but it''s not connecting with me :-( It''s just not an evocative rendering. I have several ideas on how the image could be made more powerful, but I will not presume to present them unless you let me know you are interested; perhaps this is exactly what you wanted. Certainly, my own views on the processing of landscapes are much more aggressive :-)</td>', 'It''s a lovely scene, an iconic bit of Yosemite, but it''s not connecting with me :-( It''s just not an evocative rendering. I have several ideas on how the image could be made more powerful, but I will not presume to present them unless you let me know you are interested; perhaps this is exactly what you wanted. Certainly, my own views on the processing of landscapes are much more aggressive :-)', '2022-06-02 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7721121, 1270769, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d brought up the tonality on the dandelion fluffs a little bit. It''s an evocative image, regardless.</td>', 'I wish you''d brought up the tonality on the dandelion fluffs a little bit. It''s an evocative image, regardless.', '2022-06-02 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
