(7721332, 1270394, 97814, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow thank you so much! <br/> <br/>I''m totally thrilled and my little model on the wagon will be over the moon - she was so excited to be involved and of course the dog was totally adorable.  It had been a cloudy day and I wasn''t sure if we should wait or not, but decided to go for it and as you can see, that sunset was incredible.<br/> <br/>Thank you to those of you who made comments - they are very much appreciated!<br/> <br/>Neat - yes a good hill is really hard to find where I live and I''m looking forward to doing some more sunset shots with this one!<br/> <br/>Jo<br/> <br/>I''ve never ribboned before and I think I''ve posted my comment in the wrong area!<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-06-08 00:43:43.</i></td>', 'Wow, wow thank you so much!  I''m totally thrilled and my little model on the wagon will be over the moon - she was so excited to be involved and of course the dog was totally adorable.  It had been a cloudy day and I wasn''t sure if we should wait or not, but decided to go for it and as you can see, that sunset was incredible. Thank you to those of you who made comments - they are very much appreciated! Neat - yes a good hill is really hard to find where I live and I''m looking forward to doing some more sunset shots with this one! Jo I''ve never ribboned before and I think I''ve posted my comment in the wrong area! ', '2022-06-08 01:36:47.000000', '2022-06-08 01:43:43.000000', 0),
